OL,3,AChris Brown given suspended eight-month
OL,4,Aprison sentence over London nightclub
OL,5,Aattack
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS singer Chris Brown is sentenced to
OL,8,Feight months in prison, suspended for a
OL,9,Fyear, over an incident at a nightclub
OL,10,Fin Mayfair, London in 2023
OL,12,FBrown, 37, pleaded guilty in July to a
OL,13,Fcharge of affray
OL,15,FThe victim, music producer Abe Diaw,
OL,16,Fneeded hospital treatment for head and
OL,17,Fknee injuries, with CCTV showing Brown
OL,18,Fhitting Diaw on the head with a glass
OL,19,Fbottle
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
